BT /F1 17 Tf 48 410.12 Td (ReproLab makes agent-generated repairs reviewable and repeatable for three owned Python fixtures. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 48 388.36 Td (checks outputs and lifecycle, rather than trusting a success banner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 48 358.6 Td (Arbitrary repositories and additional languages are outside this version.) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 48 328.84000000000003 Td (The trusted controller and Docker administrator remain part of the boundary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 48 299.08000000000004 Td (Integrity hashes bind recorded bytes; they are not hardware or host attestations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 17 Tf 48 269.32000000000005 Td (Successful tests are evidence for these cases, not a security audit or universal correctness proof.) Tj ET
